@startuml Huffman_Pipeline
scale 2
!theme spacelab
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45
caption v2.2.0 · 2026-09-07

title Huffman Core — 单线程核心,流水线工人各持一份私有实例

class HuffmanCompression <<adapter>> {
    - huffman : unique_ptr~Huffman~
    + compress(input, metadataOut, output)
    + decompress(metadata, input, output, originalSize)
}

class Huffman {
    - freqTab : Huffmap 「暂存当前块频率」
    - hashTab : Huffmap 「总哈希表」
    - treeRoot : HuffTreeNode*
    - pathStack : PathStack
    ..
    + statisticFreq(block)
    + finishFreqStat()
    + genHufftree()
    + saveCodeInTab()
    + treeToPlatUchar(outBlock) 「树→元数据」
    + spawnTree(inBlock) 「元数据→树」
    + encode(input, output, bitOutput)
    + decode(input, output, bitInput, maxOutputSize)
    __ private __
    - genMinheap() : unique_ptr~Minheap~
    - runSaveCodeInTab(root)
    - findchar(now, result, toward) : bool
    - connectNode(l, r) : bool
    - destroyTree(node)
}

together {
    class HuffTreeNode {
        + data : uchar
        + freq : FreqT
        + left / right : HuffTreeNode*
    }
    class CharData {
        + freq : FreqT
        + codeLen : CodeLenT
        + code : CodeT
        + add() : void
    }
}

together {
    class PathStack {
        + codeBlocks : CodeT
        + codeLen : CodeLenT
        + push(bit) / pop()
        + writeCode(cdata)
    }
    class BitHandler {
        + byte : uchar
        + bitLen : uint8_t
        + byteCount : uint64_t
        + handle(codeBlocks, codeLen, block)
        + handleLast()
    }
    class Minheap {
        优先队列:节点按频率取小
        「genMinheap() 构建期间使用」
    }
}

HuffmanCompression *--> Huffman
Huffman *--> HuffTreeNode : treeRoot
Huffman *--> PathStack
Huffman o--> CharData : hashTab 值表
Huffman ..> BitHandler : encode/decode 比特流
Huffman ..> Minheap : genMinheap
HuffTreeNode --> HuffTreeNode : left/right
HuffTreeNode o--> CharData : 叶子持字符数据
PathStack ..> CharData : writeCode

note right of Huffman
  **压缩调用链** (每 8MB 块):
  statisticFreq → finishFreqStat → genHufftree
  → saveCodeInTab → treeToPlatUchar(metadata)
  + encode(data)
  **解压调用链**:
  spawnTree(metadata) → decode(data, maxOutputSize)
end note

note bottom of HuffmanCompression
  v2.2.0: 多线程频率统计残留已删除,
  并行单位是 8MB 块(流水线工人私有实例),
  核心保持单线程语义,每块独立建树
end note

@enduml
